    "query": "gpt 5.2 high vs gpt 5.5 instant vs claude sonnet 4.6 (not thinking) vs grok 4.3 vs glm 5.1 thinking melyik a legfejlettebb zig odin es hasoblo niche nselvek kodolasaba?",
